WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-White House Press Secretary
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.636
holds a lot of press briefings,
but I don't think they've asked

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
all the questions
we need answers to,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.273
so we decided to hold another
one right here, right now.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.777
and the "Late Night" press corps
are here in our studio

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:11.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
and ready to go,
so without further ado,

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:16.082
it's time for the "Late Night
White House Press Briefing."

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.817 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:23.556 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Madam Secretary!
Madam Secretary!

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes, yes, Ms. Sanders,
thank you.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seth Meyers,
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
Secretary Sanders,
would you like to open

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
with some nonsense
to try and distract us

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the fact
that the world is burning?

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're excited
to announce today that Natalie

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.639 line:92%
and her 8-year-old cousin Celia

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.442
will be coming
to the White House on March 23rd

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
to work with the White House
kitchen staff.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.113 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.314 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-That's good nonsense.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:51.184
Moving on, President Trump
fired Rex Tillerson today.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:54.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
What did he do during his time
at the White House?

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Served out
his 12-month sentence.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:59.459 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:02.629
-When President Trump
is hiring someone for his staff,

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
what does he want to see
on their résumé?

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Organized
in transnational crime,

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
gang violence,
and other crimes.

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:12.105 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:13.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There seems to be
a lot of chaos

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.140 line:92%
in the White House these days.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's going inside
Trump's head right now?

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would never
presume to understand

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
anything going on
with that individual.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.184 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Has --
[ Cheers continue ]

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.823 line:92%
Has the Stormy Daniels scandal

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
caused Trump to curb
his adulterous behavior?

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.596
-President Trump's position on
trophy hunting remains the same.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:43.937 line:92%
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.171 line:92%
-If you wanted to hide something

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:49.409
where nobody would ever find it,
where would you put it?

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:51.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Under President Trump's
leadership.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:56.149 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What does Melania
hope to accomplish

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.053 line:92%
during her time as First Lady?

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.255 line:92%
-The goal is to get free.

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:07.827
-What's been, of all of them --
out of every single experience,

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.028 line:92%
what's been your favorite moment

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
of working
in the White House so far?

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-None of them.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What will happen
if Stormy Daniels

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.671 line:92%
releases those lurid photos?

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're gonna look.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:26.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just for scheduling purposes,
when is the impeachment?

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The event will take place
Monday, April 2nd,

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:29.549 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
on the South lawn.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:32.252 size:88% position:44%
Families with children
13 years old and younger

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:32.919 size:75% position:38% line:92%
are invited to join.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:34.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's great.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:40.260 line:92%
Fun for the whole family.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does working
in this White House

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.230 size:84% position:42% line:92%
age people prematurely?

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.232 line:92%
-I'm 11 years old, almost 12.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Hmm.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.937 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
When President Trump
got married,

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.441
did he mean it when he said
"Till death do us part"?

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:57.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The President
was clearly joking.

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:58.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.746 line:92%
-Is it true that President Trump

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
got a new snow-cone machine
for the Oval Office?

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:05.919 size:81% position:41%
-ISIS is being crushed
like it wasn't before.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.754 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:12.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sorry.
Did you say ice or ISIS?

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:16.396 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
All right.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:21.668
Can you finish this popular
children's nursery rhyme?

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:23.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ If you're happy
and you know it... ♪♪

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:26.639 size:78% position:39%
-Get a warrant to spy
on American citizens.

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.108 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:32.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Any ideas
for a "Home Alone" reboot?

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:34.981
-Kevin should be preventing
terrorists and contraband

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.516 line:92%
from entering the nation.

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:40.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles ]
Last question.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where does Melania
pretend she is

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
when she makes love
to her husband?

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:45.792 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Under Obama.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:49.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-O-o-o-o-o-o-okay!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:50.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
Looks like we're out of time,
so on behalf of the rest

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the press corps,
have a good night.

